WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:06.000
Are you a person who go for long drive only
occasionally and use your car all other time

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.450
within city? Is your kilometer usage very
less? Then why are paying high premium on

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:17.090
your car insurance when your usage is less?
You can now pay less premium on your car insurance

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:22.290
if your kilometers driven is less. You can
do this with 'Pay As You Use' car insurance

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:28.230
policy which is introduced now in India. In
this video, I will explain how to reduce your

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:33.290
car insurance costs every year using this
new type of car insurance called 'Pay As You

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.380
Use' or 'Pay As You Go'.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:41.520
Welcome to Save and Invest Smartly!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:52.660
 

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.810
The 'Pay As You Use' car insurance is a part of
the sandbox initiative, where insurers can

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:03.860
experiment and test innovative financial products.
The sandbox approach gives an opportunity

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:09.270
to experiment and learn about new technology
and product, before it’s finally adopted

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:14.350
and offered to larger set of people. The insurance
company that has rolled out 'Pay As You Use'

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:19.350
car insurance policy is ICICI Lombard General
Insurance.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:24.020
What is Pay As You Use Car Insurance policy?
This is a new type of car insurance where

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:32.480
the premium is calculated based how much distance
you drive your car. For an insurance company,

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.880
if the car is driven for lesser kilometers,
then the risk is accordingly lesser. Hence

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:40.260
they are ready to give a discount for such
users. The premiums are charged as per the

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.720
distance in kilometers.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:48.310
How is the Sum Insured calculated?
Every vehicle has an IDV - Insured Declared Value

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:54.549
fixed by the insurer based on the brand,
model and age of the vehicle. It may be approximately

00:01:54.549 --> 00:01:59.210
equivalent to the market value of the vehicle.
For example, let us consider you own a

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:04.700
car. There will be a market value for your
car as per the model, age of the car, etc.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.030
IDV is approximately equivalent to the market
value.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:12.639
Hence if the market value of your car
is 500000, then the sum insured that you will

00:02:12.639 --> 00:02:15.819
get on the insurance is Rs. 500000.

00:02:15.819 --> 00:02:20.970
How is the insurance premium calculated?
Insurance premium for a sum insured is

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:26.560
based on the Kilometers Plan that you select.
You may select for example 3000, 5000

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:33.489
or 7500 Km as the distance to be covered based
on your usage expectation. The premium will

00:02:33.489 --> 00:02:38.709
be fixed as per your selected kilometers plan.
So if you think you will only drive 3000

00:02:38.709 --> 00:02:43.769
Km in a year, then you may select the plan
accordingly and the insurance premium will

00:02:43.769 --> 00:02:49.159
be far lesser than the regular premium. But
you will get the same sum assured as per the IDV

00:02:49.159 --> 00:02:51.249
 

00:02:51.249 --> 00:02:55.810
What are the Coverage Options that are available?
You may choose any of the 2 coverage options

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:59.799
available.
Option 1: Stand Alone Own Damage Cover

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:05.420
Own Damage Insurance&nbsp;is a customized motor&nbsp;insurance&nbsp;policy
designed to protect you and your insured vehicle

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:10.359
from your&nbsp;own damages. That is, this policy
covers against any loss or damage to your

00:03:10.359 --> 00:03:15.500
vehicle or its accessories due to:&nbsp;
1. Fire, explosion, self-ignition, accidental

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.449
damage
2. Transit, that is when the vehicle is shifted

00:03:18.449 --> 00:03:22.620
from one place to another
3. Natural disasters like earthquake, flood,

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:27.860
cyclone, etc.
4. Burglary, theft, riot, etc.,

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:31.109
Option 2: Own Damage with Third Party
This option covers everything in Option 1

00:03:31.109 --> 00:03:34.920
plus the third party coverage.
Third party policy&nbsp;covers the&nbsp;insured&nbsp;against

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:40.699
any legal liability arising out towards third
parties due to accidental injury or death

00:03:40.699 --> 00:03:44.859
of a person and any damage caused to third
party property.

00:03:44.859 --> 00:03:47.920
Lets see the Advantages of 'Pay As You Use'
Insurance policy

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:53.269
You will Pay low premiums if your usage
is less. That is if you drive for only few

00:03:53.269 --> 00:03:58.889
kilometers in a year, then you pay far lesser
premium amount than the regular car insurance.

00:03:58.889 --> 00:04:04.700
A Free telematics device is provided to
you to track your car's health and your driving

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:09.219
patterns. The insurance company will help
in installing this telematics device to your car.

00:04:09.219 --> 00:04:12.139
A telematics mobile app can be installed

00:04:12.139 --> 00:04:16.590
in your mobile, so that you can track your
car's health, kilometers used up in the plan

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:21.900
and also you have options to top up, etc.
If you exceed the kilometers selected,

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:26.820
then you can easily topup by paying additional
premium again for whatever kilometers you select.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.280
The telematics device also sends data

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:33.750
to your insurer so that they can send reminders
when top up is required.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.400
How to apply for 'Pay As You Use' policy?

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.430
If you want to get the insurance from ICICI
Lombard General Insurance,

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:46.260
visit www.icicilombard.com. You will see
various menu options.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:50.290
Click on Products and then select the
option "Pay As You Use".

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.790
You will get a form to fill up your name,
mobile number and email id. Fill up the details

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:59.320
and select the Kilometers plan from the drop
down. This is to arrive at the premium for

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:03.320
you based on your usage.
Now tick the check box to agree the terms

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.761
and conditions. Click on Proceed.
This will take you to the next page. From

00:05:07.761 --> 00:05:11.449
the first drop down, select the make and model
of the car.

00:05:11.449 --> 00:05:16.000
From the next drop down select the year
of registration of the car and from the third

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.230
drop down select the city where the car is
registered. Click on 'Submit'.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:24.470
The insurance agent will contact you to
get further details from you and proceed with

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.830
the documentation.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:30.330
The 'Pay As You Use' policy will definitely
save you a lot of money on your car insurance

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:35.100
if your usage is less. Give it a try when
you apply or renew your car insurance next

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:39.290
time. Let me know your thoughts on this new
policy type in the comments section. Also,

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.680
write down if you have more queries on this.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:46.470
